      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kr%C4%8D"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Renowned writers Antal Stašek and Ivan Olbracht once lived in a villa in northern Krč, inspiring local literary heritage.",
